FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM maven:3.9-eclipse-temurin-21 AS build
ARG MODULE
ARG MAVEN_MIRROR_URL
WORKDIR /src
COPY . .
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.m2 \
    set -eu; \
    case "$MODULE" in service-gateway|service-dataplane|service-scheduler) ;; *) exit 1 ;; esac; \
    settings_args=""; \
    if [ -n "${MAVEN_MIRROR_URL:-}" ]; then \
      printf '%s\n' \
        '<settings xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/SETTINGS/1.0.0"' \
        '          xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"' \
        '          xsi:schemaLocation="http://maven.apache.org/SETTINGS/1.0.0 https://maven.apache.org/xsd/settings-1.0.0.xsd">' \
        '  <mirrors><mirror><id>build-mirror</id><mirrorOf>*</mirrorOf><url>'"$MAVEN_MIRROR_URL"'</url></mirror></mirrors>' \
        '</settings>' > /tmp/maven-settings.xml; \
      settings_args="-s /tmp/maven-settings.xml"; \
    fi; \
    mvn -B -ntp $settings_args \
      -Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.count=5 \
      -Dmaven.wagon.httpconnectionManager.ttlSeconds=60 \
      -pl agentscope-service/$MODULE -am package -DskipTests \
    && mkdir /out \
    && find agentscope-service/$MODULE/target -maxdepth 1 -name "$MODULE-*.jar" \
       ! -name '*sources*' ! -name '*javadoc*' -exec cp {} /out/app.jar \;

FROM eclipse-temurin:21-jre
RUN apt-get -o Acquire::Retries=5 update \
    && apt-get -o Acquire::Retries=5 install -y --no-install-recommends curl \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && groupadd --gid 65532 agentscope \
    && useradd --uid 65532 --gid 65532 --home-dir /data --no-create-home agentscope \
    && mkdir -p /data/workspaces /data/artifacts \
    && chown -R 65532:65532 /data
COPY --from=build /out/app.jar /app.jar
ENV BUILDER_WORKSPACE_ROOT=/data/workspaces
USER 65532:65532
EXPOSE 8080
ENTRYPOINT ["java", "-jar", "/app.jar"]
